            "review_title": "Review at Kouzina - Greek Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Travelbanana\nDa Nang, Vietnam27 contributions\n2\nBest recommendation ever\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nLoving Greek food and culture so much, we ventured over to Kouzina on a recommendation from a close friend. The two owners greeted us with welcoming smiles showed us to a lovely table. It just got better from there, the food amazing the decor made us long back to our holidays in Greece. This is definitely a must visit if your hungry prices where good, food fantastic and service to match\nWritten February 11, 2020",
