            "review_text": "Scott_G972USA\nDa Nang, Vietnam51 contributions\n4\nIncredible greek food with excellent service. Great value for the money.\nDec 2019\nMy friends and I got the greek platter with 5 different grilled meats, veggies and a greek salad. This was big enough to feed 4 people and cost 500,000 VND. I was there last week at lunch and got a really good pork gyro sandwich for 60,000. So you can enjoy a casual inexpensive meal or a celebration meal with good value for the money.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2019",
