            "review_text": "chris gkd\nLondon, United Kingdom2 contributions\n4\nExcellent food, very warm hospitality!\nDec 2019 • Business\nI wasn't expecting to find a Greek restaurant in Vietnam with Greek manager and chef! The food is pure Greek, everything is homemade, even the yogurt and the traditional pita bread! The staff is speaking quite well English, something that it very hard to meet in hospitality places here in Vietnam! A MUST VISIT PLACE IN DA NANG CITY!!\nWritten December 19, 2019",
