            "review_title": "Review at Kouzina - Greek Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thanh N\nDa Nang, Vietnam9 contributions\n3\nThe Best Greek restaurant in Danang\nDec 2019\nI went there yesterday with my family its fairly a new restaurant and the first Greek restaurant in Danang. The first thing I notize when entering the restaurant is that The Manager is Greek and found later out that the Head Chef is Greek as well which is always a good sign. My family order few starters like the Greek Salad, fried calamari and the Alifes which is like pita bread with 6 kind of mix sauces/ dibs....everything very tasty and in big portion as well. For the main course we order the big meat platter for the whole family....which was REALLY big. The meat platter is a combination of different meat like lamb, chicken, pork and german sausage and french fried with salad. The meat was tender and good flavor. The Greek Manager was very attentive and was always asking about the food and asking about our experience of the food....super service. After the meal we got free dessert as well.......super experince in KOUZINA....will for sure return :-)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 17, 2019",
